      "name": "Note 4. Replies, bounces, uns",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 4. Replies, bounces, unsubscribes\nPOST the inbound email to /webhook/outreach-reply. An unsubscribe or bounce stops the sequence immediately (no AI involved).\nInterested replies and questions email you.\nYour outreach mailbox is also polled over IMAP every 15 minutes (bottom lane), so replies are picked up without a webhook.",
